{"abstract":"The Bureau of Indian Affairs (BIA) owns or has an interest in irrigation projects located on or associated with various Indian reservations throughout the United States. We are required to establish irrigation assessment rates to recover the costs to administer, operate, maintain, and rehabilitate these projects. We request your comments on the proposed rate adjustments.","action":"Notice.","agencies":[{"id":253,"json_url":"https://www.federalregister.gov/api/v1/agencies/253","name":"Interior Department","parent_id":null,"raw_name":"DEPARTMENT OF THE INTERIOR","slug":"interior-department","url":"https://www.federalregister.gov/agencies/interior-department"},{"id":234,"json_url":"https://www.federalregister.gov/api/v1/agencies/234","name":"Indian Affairs Bureau","parent_id":253,"raw_name":"Bureau of Indian Affairs","slug":"indian-affairs-bureau","url":"https://www.federalregister.gov/agencies/indian-affairs-bureau"}],"body_html_url":"https://www.federalregister.gov/documents/full_text/html/2022/04/01/2022-06748.html","cfr_references":[],"citation":"87 FR 19116","comment_url":null,"comments_close_on":"2022-05-31","correction_of":null,"corrections":[],"dates":"Interested parties may submit comments on the proposed rate adjustments on or before May 31, 2022.","disposition_notes":null,"docket_ids":["223A2100DD/AAKC001030/A0A501010.999900"],"dockets":[],"document_number":"2022-06748","effective_on":null,"end_page":19121,"executive_order_notes":null,"executive_order_number":null,"full_text_xml_url":"https://www.federalregister.gov/documents/full_text/xml/2022/04/01/2022-06748.xml","html_url":"https://www.federalregister.gov/documents/2022/04/01/2022-06748/rate-adjustments-for-indian-irrigation-projects","images":{},"images_metadata":{},"json_url":"https://www.federalregister.gov/api/v1/documents/2022-06748?publication_date=2022-04-01","mods_url":"https://www.govinfo.gov/metadata/granule/FR-2022-04-01/2022-06748/mods.xml","not_received_for_publication":null,"pa